{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39967","headline":"偶吟 · 徐夤","name":"偶吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千卷长书万首诗，朝蒸藜藿暮烹葵。\n清时名立难皆我，晚岁途穷亦问谁。\n碧岸钓归惟独笑，青山耕徧亦何爲。\n寻常抖擞怀中策，可便降他两鬓丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}